              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Baabuúwók nee aayoorók ilaiwawa/eek adoodá' anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúwók, una hara'ayiím, adoorí tleehheek as slafíngw kureeraá yaariir kuwa sleer, nee diihhooa kawa sleer baraá yaamuudá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Munguúwók ni kuúngií haniisi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.16"
            ]
