              "DEU.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Kaangwí an axweesanaydá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ naa dír dinku'uumarhúng sleémeero wa axweés ar afór ur gawaá tloomár wa ale, baraá tla/ángw asltá wa ale, nee baraá huunki nee baraá ma/amír aa qipit, tam axweesantá aa doók i káhh. Axweesantí gari gooín gawaá tlaa/eedá' tsár awa parereehhayen ngiri dir'eéní haniís.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Qoomár afoodá' kawa axasé' baraá tla/ángw giwti, nee asla iwa gawaá tloomár wa ot, geeraharuusér tlahhi'iihúng sleémeero nee bariise nina dir'eéní hardihiyé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín tari oó', ‹Iia qaaseek! AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúrén taa xirfuuwós i laqán nee uraywós, afoorós aga axaasaán baraá tla/ángw asltádá'. Laarír kilá' Mungú ugwa araán iwa axweesi nee hee, slám kitángw hee iwa gwaai ina kumiít hotaawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsaxwaá gwa'ara awa asltadá' ur gár tis slaya a milá? Afór AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúrén bara male axasaán, atén a qatlaán! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xáy, a hee gaalá oo Munguú slaáf gwa axaás oo baraá tla/ángw asltá wa axweés, adoodá' atén kura axasaán nee tay hotaán? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsiní kuúng, Mose, bihhiiqá' i tseewuweek, tidá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúrén i kaahi ngi iiárií qás, daqaní ni hardát, tidá' sleémeero ngi diréní ooár eér. Atén iia a qaasaán ngiri boo/eesaán.›",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«AAKOÓ MUNGÚ axweesantahúng sleémeero gana axaás, aníng iri báy, ‹Axweesantadá' naa kuúng bayé' aga axaás sleémeero, nee axweesantadá' sleémeero i qoón. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hám geera a tsiní barnaxes i meetiyá' gawaá inslawaydá' aníng iwa ilaiwawa/iya', nee hara'ayar'eé' ngiwa oohiya' umuu daqto. Geera muruuín sleémeero oo ta tlehhiiti iri ganaa' umuú daqto dir'ine nee dír na/ii'ine ay alhhe'eesay wasle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tláw ádbaweek, i ki/iye' amór heemaduuín. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala kuúng Mose, dir'eé' tí tseew i sihhiiteek! Aníng kuúng un hara'ayar'eé' sleémeero báw, nee kaahir'eene, nee daber'eene, tidá' ta dir'íní intsaahhatis as tawa adoorír hooti baraá yaamuudá' ni inooín haniisa tawa aalir'ín.›",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Kuungá' masók ti harmagahhá' nee adoodá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Munguúhúng naa hara'ayín kawa tlehha', baraá kaahirose ma bihhií paranga/aara'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kangwdá' sleémeero AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng naa hara'ayín eeharaak, as tidá' sleémeero kuungá' ta tlehha' iwa qoon, nee deelór hotaahung kiwa sleera' baraá yaamuudá' ta sleera'a, tawa aalirhúng.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
